    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572050/extras/d70077715e39c98130504ae7e0b43547.poster.avif?t=1751341779\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572050/extras/d70077715e39c98130504ae7e0b43547.webm?t=1751341779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Years, Sole Developer, CatTrigger has been developing horror games and stories.  Now, they're all finally compiled into this tight-knit collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection comes with Director's Cut material from all of CatTrigger's games, Behind-the-Scenes Material, comics as well as... a DARK SECRET WITHIN THE COLLECTION ITSELF?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Health Clinics, Haunted Dating Sims, Sprawling Tunnels and More...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572050/extras/5c2d5385fe59d2e24cfbd20b0f7b24da.avif?t=1751341779\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 7  horror games by CatTrigger, including Classic Versions of Date Time, Secrets to Success with Dr. Brain, No Robots Allowed &amp; Bad Faith all with Director's Cut content made specifically for the collection.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the slow horrid mutation of a child in a health clinic, prove you're human to a killer robot or guide a hapless victim through dark sprawling tunnels.  Each story is unique in both story and style ranging from Comedy Horror, Sci-Fi and Dreadful Body Horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Heart Pumping Horror Interactive Stories, each with their own set of characters, secrets and monsters!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small collection of horror comics drawn by CatTrigger, both presented in an animated format, as well as static format for easy reading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact and Abuse CatTrigger as you play through their games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THERE'S SOMETHING DREADFUL INSIDE THE COLLECTION ITSELF, CAN YOU FIND IT?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun Behind-The-Scenes material for each game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">I LOVE MY EYES!</span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572050/extras/d70077715e39c98130504ae7e0b43547.poster.avif?t=1751341779\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572050/extras/d70077715e39c98130504ae7e0b43547.webm?t=1751341779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Years, Sole Developer, CatTrigger has been developing horror games and stories.  Now, they're all finally compiled into this tight-knit collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection comes with Director's Cut material from all of CatTrigger's games, Behind-the-Scenes Material, comics as well as... a DARK SECRET WITHIN THE COLLECTION ITSELF?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Health Clinics, Haunted Dating Sims, Sprawling Tunnels and More...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572050/extras/5c2d5385fe59d2e24cfbd20b0f7b24da.avif?t=1751341779\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 7  horror games by CatTrigger, including Classic Versions of Date Time, Secrets to Success with Dr. Brain, No Robots Allowed &amp; Bad Faith all with Director's Cut content made specifically for the collection.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the slow horrid mutation of a child in a health clinic, prove you're human to a killer robot or guide a hapless victim through dark sprawling tunnels.  Each story is unique in both story and style ranging from Comedy Horror, Sci-Fi and Dreadful Body Horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Heart Pumping Horror Interactive Stories, each with their own set of characters, secrets and monsters!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small collection of horror comics drawn by CatTrigger, both presented in an animated format, as well as static format for easy reading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact and Abuse CatTrigger as you play through their games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THERE'S SOMETHING DREADFUL INSIDE THE COLLECTION ITSELF, CAN YOU FIND IT?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun Behind-The-Scenes material for each game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">I LOVE MY EYES!</span></p></li></ul>",
